  bio_en = $q$<h3>Education</h3><ul><li>B.S., Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering, KAIST (2011)</li><li>Ph.D., Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering, KAIST (2017)</li></ul><h3>Experience</h3><ul><li>Postdoctoral Researcher, Polymer Science and Engineering, University of Massachusetts Amherst (2017–2020)</li><li>Assistant Professor, Department of Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering, Sogang University (2021–2025)</li><li>Associate Professor, Department of Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering, Sogang University (2025–present)</li></ul><h3>Selected Awards</h3><ul><li>The 9th Korea Toray Fellowship (2026)</li><li>Young Scholar Award, The Polymer Society of Korea (2023)</li><li>Sogang Ricci Engineering Young Fellow (2023)</li><li>Sogang Ricci Excellence in Teaching Award (2021)</li><li>Frank J. Padden Jr. Award Finalist, Division of Polymer Physics, American Physical Society (2017)</li></ul><h3>Professional Service</h3><ul><li>Steering Committee Member, The Polymer Society of Korea (2023–2025)</li><li>Editorial Board Member, Polymer Science and Technology, The Polymer Society of Korea (2022–2024)</li><li>Editorial Secretary, Polymer Division, The Korean Institute of Chemical Engineers (2023)</li></ul><h3>Selected Publications</h3><ul><li><p>Younghoon Kim, Chankyu Kim, Seungju Lee, Chan-Hyuk Jeon, Han Hee Cho*, and Hyeong Jun Kim*, "<a href="https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.nanolett.6c02638" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Kinetically Arrested Interfacial Polyelectrolyte Complexes Enable Ionic Rectification in Ionoelastomer Heterojunctions</a>," <em>Nano Letters</em> 26, 12725-12733 (2026)</p></li><li><p>Chankyu Kim†, Chan-Hyuk Jeon†, Jowon Shin, Younghoon Kim, Owen A. Lee, Ryan C. Hayward, and Hyeong Jun Kim*, "Electrically Induced Glass Transition in Polyelectrolyte Complexes Enables Kinetic Ionic Diodes," <em>Nature Communications</em> (2026)</p></li><li><p>Yongsu Kim, Youngwon Lee, Ji Hee Yun, Noh-Moon Lee, Bonjae Koo, Jonggeol Na*, and Hyeong Jun Kim*, "<a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-76086-2" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Recoverable Macroporous Polyanion Bead Catalysts for Scalable Continuous Chemical Depolymerization of Poly(Ethylene Terephthalate)</a>," <em>Nature Communications</em> 17, 9204 (2026)</p></li><li><p>Jowon Shin, Heewoon Shin, Sang-Ho Lee, Jong Dae Jang, and Hyeong Jun Kim*, "<a href="https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acsmacrolett.4c00663" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Influence of Solvent Dielectric Constant on the Complex Coacervation Phase Behavior of Polymerized Ionic Liquids (PILs)</a>," <em>ACS Macro Letters</em> 13, 12, 1678-1685 (2024)</p></li><li><p>Sehwan Park, Yoon-Je Choi, Soonyong So and Hyeong Jun Kim*, "<a href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adfm.202409443" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Electrostatic Clutches Based on Ionomer Heterojunctions for Low-Voltage Switching of Stiffness and Strength</a>," <em>Advanced Functional Materials</em> 2409443 (2024)</p></li><li><p>Hyeong Jun Kim, Baohong Chen, Zhigang Suo*, and Ryan C. Hayward*, "<a href="https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aay8467" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Ionoelastomer Junctions Between Polymer Networks of Fixed Anions and Cations</a>," <em>Science</em> 367, 773 (2020)</p></li></ul>$q$
